   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">High-key faded pastel: very bright median (~200), blacks lifted to ~140 in the brightest frames, near-monochrome saturation (0.08), neutral-warm skin. Best for: Ethereal bridal portraits, veils and white dresses, bright overcast or backlit frames, minimalist editorial. Strong stylisation - use on clean, simple compositions.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
